    # "You pull her closer."
    "La acercas más a ti."

# TODO: Translation updated at 2026-09-30 22:57

translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:628
    old "When you finished inside me, some part of me was hoping it would take. I just never had the guts to say it out loud."
    new "Cuando acabaste dentro de mí, una parte de mí esperaba que pegara. Solo que nunca tuve las agallas de decirlo en voz alta."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:676
    old "I never said it out loud 'cause it sounded crazy. But when you stayed inside me, I was prayin' it would take."
    new "Nunca lo dije en voz alta porque sonaba loco. Pero cuando te quedaste dentro de mí, estaba rezando para que pegara."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:723
    old "And then when you came inside me, I caught myself hoping. Like an idiot."
    new "Y luego cuando acabaste dentro de mí, me descubrí esperanzada. Como una idiota."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:769
    old "I never told you, but when you finished inside me, I was h-hoping. Is that bad? That's bad, isn't it?"
    new "Nunca te lo dije, pero cuando acabaste dentro de mí, estaba e-esperanzada. ¿Eso es malo? Es malo, ¿verdad?"

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:808
    old "When you finished inside me, I was hoping this would happen."
    new "Cuando acabaste dentro de mí, esperaba que esto pasara."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "And money? Not your problem. My family will cover every cent of it."
    new "¿Y el dinero? No es tu problema. Mi familia va a cubrir cada centavo."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "They'd rather sign checks than ask questions. So you're off the hook for the money. Not for the rest."
    new "Prefieren firmar cheques que hacer preguntas. Así que te libras del dinero. No del resto."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "M-money isn't the problem, at least. My parents will pay for everything. Doctors, diapers, all of it."
    new "E-el dinero no es el problema, al menos. Mis papás van a pagar todo. Doctores, pañales, todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "So you don't have to pay anything. I just... I still need you there. Please."
    new "Así que no tienes que pagar nada. Solo... todavía te necesito ahí. Por favor."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "Okay, practical stuff. Money is the one thing my family is actually good for. They'll cover all of it."
    new "Bueno, lo práctico. El dinero es lo único para lo que mi familia realmente sirve. Van a cubrir todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "So your wallet's safe. Your weekends, on the other hand, are mine now."
    new "Así que tu cartera está a salvo. Tus fines de semana, en cambio, ahora son míos."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "Now don't you fret about the money, sugar. My family's got it covered, every last cent."
    new "Ahora no te angusties por el dinero, cariño. Mi familia lo tiene cubierto, hasta el último centavo."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "You just worry 'bout bein' there. That's the part money can't buy."
    new "Tú solo preocúpate por estar ahí. Esa es la parte que el dinero no puede comprar."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "At least money isn't a problem. My family will cover all of it."
    new "Al menos el dinero no es problema. Mi familia va a cubrir todo."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:828
    old "You don't have to pay anything. Just be there for us."
    new "No tienes que pagar nada. Solo quédate a nuestro lado."

    # game/scripts/Events/pregnancy_discovery.rpy:1243
    old "When I came inside you... I wanted this."
    new "Cuando acabé dentro de ti... quería esto."

